<title>USA: Franklin Quest appoints John Theler CFO.</title>
<headline>Franklin Quest appoints John Theler CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Quest Co said Thursday that John Theler has been appointed chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Theler was corporate controller at Rubbermaid Inc before joining Franklin Quest, the company said.</p>
<p>Franklin Quest said former Chief Financial Officer Jon Rowberry became the chief operating officer in a restructuring during September.</p>
</text>
